			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Hello all
<br />

<br />
My name is Tweena and I am currently interested in apping for 5R. To start I will post a little history of Tweena. As I am sure that some of you knew Tweena from the LoS days she used to be owned by Qanlain. I aquirred Tweena roughly 6 months ago from Qan when he was quitting for I needed a change of scenery character wise and did not want to go through the whole leveling process over again to play a ranger. I have played over 3 years and personally had 2 accounts before Tweena with a level 65 monk (Kurrgen) and a level 59 shaman (Elriic). I then made Tweena my main character and focussed all my time on her since.
<br />

<br />
Since that time I have been involved till recently with another raiding guild named Stratageme. I have accumulated alot of experience in raiding lower tier zones, and improved Tweena alot over that time. Although the people in Stratageme where very awesome in alot of ways, I felt I needed more to help fulfill my EQ experience. Hence why I am here.
<br />

<br />
Being successful at raiding I have found requires 1 simple rule of thumb. Be quiet and listen to those in charge following there direction. They know what they are doing. If you follow there lead you maxmize your chance to help the team overcome its foe, and in the interm you learn more about your character and how to play.
<br />

<br />
Although I am 32 with wife and kids I try to get on as early as possible and play 5 days a week on average. My usual start time is around 8:30PM EST and can play till when ever I desire. I had a 69% attendance record in the past with Stratageme for raids. Tweena currently has 112 aaxp and all her major aa slots filled including AM3, EQ, CD3, IC and more. She is flagged up to Sol Ro Tower and just requires Fire and Time access to complete them. Her magelo is linked below her sig and has been recently updated for viewing.</span><span class="postbody"></span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
